  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::State
  storyText: "Kabuki Streets\n\nOutside, the night market steams: noodle stands, cheap chrome, a Delamain cab gliding past. A netrunner bursts out of an alley, slams into you and shoves a shard into your jacket.\n\n\"Run,\" she whispers. Seconds later an unmarked AV opens fire and she drops.\n\n1. Run.\n2. Toss the shard into a trash compactor."
